# Keep host build artifacts out of the Docker build context. Critical for the
# baked CI image (Dockerfile.ci): a host macOS .venv or node_modules copied over
# the image's freshly built Linux ones would break the container.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.entrypoint-cache
**/prebuilds
**/.nuxt
**/dist
.git
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report

# Secrets: never bake a .env into the image (std-mzhg). Prod config comes from
# Fly secrets and fly.toml [env] at runtime, so no .env is needed in the build.
**/.env
**/.env.*
